  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}咦，理世也不知道？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 01 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}嗯……\n没有要扑过来的迹象，\n似乎也和Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ不同。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 07 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 DE 04}我想它应该……不是敌人，\n不过特别在意大家。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:7:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……也许是在等我们。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}在等我们……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}说不定，和爱丽丝的故事\n有什么关系……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:8:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}故事开头……\n爱丽丝追着“兔子”掉进洞里，\n误入了不可思议之国……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那是不是跟着那只兔子走比较好……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C0 11}跟着它吧！\n兔子是朋友哦！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 06 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C0 03}朋、朋友，这可还说不准哦？\n也有可能是敌人……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，也许能成为线索哦？\n在迷宫里遇见可能不是敌人的存在，\n还是第一次呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这、这样啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}我也想追上它。\n我好像……记得在哪里见过……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}它也许是与善和玲的记忆\n有关的“某种东西”呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0152",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 81}学长，该怎么办？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_200.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_016",
